# Accepted findings for this demo; each needs a reason.

# EKS public API endpoint: required to run kubectl and the kubernetes
# workspace from a workstation or CloudShell. Access is limited to
# var.api_allowed_cidrs (no default). AWS-0041 flags any public CIDR, even a
# single /32, so it is accepted for the same reason.
AWS-0040
AWS-0041

# Node security group egress to 0.0.0.0/0 (terraform-aws-modules/eks
# "egress_all" rule): nodes pull images from Docker Hub and reach AWS APIs
# through the NAT gateway.
AWS-0104
